      "value": "As mentioned before in conversation, I think you'd get the most traction asking for an application form for everyone to apply to a group. Once that groundwork is laid (if they're interested), it could further be asked to allow staff forms (or just have a secondary staff group for applications).\n\nI do support the idea, but this will probably get lost as niche without the underlying framework.",
