  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-04-29T20:04:41.610Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "in a group, it would be tremendosly useful to have a form-like section for members to apply as staff, maybe basing it on the time that they spent into the group as a way of gating people who just join and apply right away.\n\ndon't like it?\n\nand also the ability to toggle off the applications in case the group is not looking to expand.",
